    <briefdescription>
<para>American exercise. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An American option can be exercised at any time between two predefined dates; the first date might be omitted, in which case the option can be exercised at any time before the expiry.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000003"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>check that everywhere the American condition is applied from earliestDate and not earlier </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
